{title: Rim Jhim Gire Sawan}
{artist: Kishore Kumar R D Burman}
{key: Dm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Dm],        Rimjhim Gire Sawan,
[Gm],        Sulag Sulag jaaye man
[C],        Bheege aaj is mausam mein,
[C] [Dm],        lagi kaisi yeh agan
[Dm] [Gm],        jab ghungruon si,
[Gm] [A],        bajti hai boondein
[A] [Gm],        armaan hamaare,
[Gm] [Dm],        palkein naa moondein
[Dm],        kaise dekhen sapne nayan
[Gm],        Sulag Sulag jaaye man
[C],        Bheege aaj is mausam mein,
[C] [Dm],        lagi kaisi yeh agan
[Dm] [Gm],        Mahfil mein kaise
[Gm] [A],        kahde kisi se
[A] [Gm],        Dil bandh raha hain
[Gm] [Dm],        ek ajnabi se
[Dm],        Haaye karein ab kya jatan,
[Gm],        Sulag Sulag jaaye man
[C],        Bheege aaj is mausam mein,
[C] [Dm],        lagi kaisi yeh agan
